WEBVTT

00:28.430 --> 00:29.550
General!

00:30.170 --> 00:32.060
We're approaching the landing area.

00:33.150 --> 00:35.550
We will begin landing shortly.

00:38.230 --> 00:43.060
Attention! This war is by 
order of our great king!

00:43.460 --> 00:48.570
Let us teach those cursed demons 
the true power of humans!

01:00.330 --> 01:03.590
I sensed a trace of Toma's magic power.

01:04.320 --> 01:06.760
There's no doubt he's on this continent.

01:07.730 --> 01:11.340
So our true enemy is not 
the demonic nation, but...

01:12.110 --> 01:14.840
Toma, most definitely.

01:15.470 --> 01:18.340
But the general and the 
others are all riled up.

01:18.340 --> 01:23.320
Even if we tried to tell 
them Toma is behind this,

01:23.320 --> 01:26.100
they'd probably just treat us as spies.

01:26.420 --> 01:31.360
But at this rate, we'll start a 
pointless war with the demons.

01:34.230 --> 01:37.360
Have we heard from Setsu-san at all?

01:39.640 --> 01:43.370
Yuki-kun is probably doing 
his best to stop this war.

01:47.410 --> 01:51.710
To tell you the truth, this is actually the 
second time I got summoned into this world.

01:52.250 --> 01:53.600
Second time?

01:53.600 --> 01:58.230
So, to stop this war, I'm going 
to go meet an old acquaintance.

01:59.530 --> 02:02.870
If you're going somewhere, 
I'm going with you!

02:02.870 --> 02:05.060
I want to go with you!

02:05.430 --> 02:09.970
I promise I'll be useful! So please, I...

02:09.970 --> 02:12.520
No. It's too dangerous for you, Yuhi.

02:13.060 --> 02:17.490
Besides, this is something I have to do.

02:17.830 --> 02:20.960
Then that's all the more reason...

02:24.150 --> 02:28.260
I'm going because I don't 
want to put you in danger.

02:29.990 --> 02:32.320
I trust Yuki-kun!

02:34.480 --> 02:36.890
So what we should do is...

02:36.890 --> 02:41.180
Buy time until Setsu-sama arrives, I guess.

02:41.470 --> 02:46.660
Yuhi, in this war, we have to prevent 
casualties as much as possible.

02:47.560 --> 02:49.940
You can do it.

02:50.620 --> 02:52.440
Believe in yourself.

02:53.730 --> 02:54.550
Right!

02:57.200 --> 03:00.530
Let's win back the peace we once had!

03:01.270 --> 03:02.060
Right!

03:01.270 --> 03:02.060
Yes!

03:01.270 --> 03:02.060
Yeah!

04:34.210 --> 04:38.960
<b><i>Episode 10</i></b>

04:34.210 --> 04:38.960
<b><i>Arriving at a Battlefield for a Second Time</i></b>

04:54.960 --> 04:56.370
Charge!

05:04.170 --> 05:05.420
Aim!

05:06.530 --> 05:07.690
Fire!

05:11.950 --> 05:15.580
Listen! We will circle around the 
flank and strike the enemy!

05:15.930 --> 05:16.670
Right!

05:20.840 --> 05:23.590
Magic soldiers! Fire!

05:29.090 --> 05:33.180
Target: enemy encampment! Charge!

05:35.600 --> 05:36.890
Here they come!

05:36.890 --> 05:38.980
Don't let them set foot in our camp!

05:48.950 --> 05:51.450
Now! Go, go!

05:51.450 --> 05:52.750
Go, go!

05:52.750 --> 05:54.080
For the kingdom!

05:54.080 --> 05:56.190
Defeat our enemies!

06:05.220 --> 06:09.630
Listen. Don't go chasing after 
fleeing or injured enemies.

06:09.630 --> 06:13.070
We'll wait for the enemy to focus 
their attention on the front,

06:13.070 --> 06:14.390
then charge through in one go.

06:14.640 --> 06:16.220
R-Right.

06:17.410 --> 06:19.140
Okay, let's go!

06:23.150 --> 06:24.980
We're under attack!

06:34.830 --> 06:36.930
Wh-What should I do?!

06:36.930 --> 06:38.960
We just have to fight!

06:38.960 --> 06:41.810
Yes, get them before they get us!

06:42.930 --> 06:44.590
Yeah! Let's do it!

06:44.590 --> 06:45.960
Hey, everyone!

06:45.960 --> 06:48.700
Wait! Don't leave me!

06:49.920 --> 06:50.590
What?!

06:50.590 --> 06:52.260
I've got you!

06:54.370 --> 06:55.720
Are you all right?

06:57.120 --> 07:02.200
Yuhi-chan! Sorry! I'm so sorry! I got scared...

07:02.200 --> 07:04.060
I couldn't do anything...

07:04.940 --> 07:08.850
Don't apologize. I'm scared, too.

07:08.850 --> 07:11.210
Just don't push yourself too hard, okay?

07:11.210 --> 07:11.760
Yeah...

07:11.760 --> 07:13.960
Retreat!

07:27.450 --> 07:30.800
I did it... I did it, damn it!

07:31.660 --> 07:35.510
This is war. I have to kill...

07:36.080 --> 07:38.020
Don't blame me for this.

07:38.420 --> 07:39.100
No!

07:40.440 --> 07:42.960
Wh-What are you saying, Hanabashira?

07:42.960 --> 07:45.110
That person can't move anymore, right?!

07:45.400 --> 07:46.260
So...

07:46.260 --> 07:47.900
Why'd you stop me?!

07:49.040 --> 07:51.310
It's kill or be killed!

07:51.310 --> 07:53.860
Th-That's what war is, right?!

07:54.160 --> 07:59.200
So it's okay to kill someone 
who's hurt, who can't fight?!

07:59.200 --> 08:01.080
That's wrong!

08:03.870 --> 08:06.050
How noble!

08:06.840 --> 08:10.450
But you need to end their lives...

08:10.450 --> 08:12.190
or this is what will happen!

08:32.320 --> 08:33.360
<i>That's...</i>

08:38.950 --> 08:40.870
<i>From back then...</i>

08:47.970 --> 08:50.630
Who are you? Which squad—

08:59.910 --> 09:01.340
Damn it! More enemies!

09:01.340 --> 09:02.720
Kill them!

09:04.840 --> 09:06.300
Are these reinforcements?

09:06.300 --> 09:08.610
Good, we can push back the—

09:09.900 --> 09:10.890
Ice Flower!

09:17.610 --> 09:21.240
This is bad. Everyone's lost their cool.

09:21.680 --> 09:24.870
Hey, Glein, are they perhaps...

09:25.790 --> 09:29.130
Yeah... They seem to contain people.

09:29.760 --> 09:31.700
How awful...

09:31.700 --> 09:34.650
That red-haired swordswoman, she's—

09:44.500 --> 09:47.390
No, it can't be...

09:52.850 --> 09:55.650
There's no doubt. That swordswoman is...

10:05.510 --> 10:06.620
Alizee!

10:07.450 --> 10:10.340
What, you know her?

10:10.340 --> 10:14.170
Oh, I guess you were all 
in Setsu's party together.

10:14.460 --> 10:17.050
What did you do to Alizee?!

10:17.820 --> 10:22.050
She was powerful, so I turned her into a doll!

10:22.430 --> 10:23.430
A doll?!

10:25.930 --> 10:29.630
Why don't you become my puppets, too?

10:29.630 --> 10:32.530
Then you can all stay together forever.

10:32.530 --> 10:33.900
I know!

10:34.260 --> 10:37.860
Let's form a puppet party!

10:38.310 --> 10:39.360
Okay?

10:39.660 --> 10:41.030
Enough!

10:41.030 --> 10:41.820
Elka!

10:45.200 --> 10:47.100
Marionette Magic.

10:52.960 --> 10:57.310
Alizee! It's me, Elka! 
Don't you recognize me?!

10:58.420 --> 10:59.440
Alizee!

11:04.850 --> 11:06.700
You two can deal with this.

11:18.900 --> 11:21.760
Wh-What is she doing?

11:21.760 --> 11:23.910
That's not just regular blood.

11:28.410 --> 11:30.410
It's concentrated magic power.

11:34.740 --> 11:36.420
So she must be...

11:36.780 --> 11:40.260
Sorry, I forgot to introduce myself.

11:40.260 --> 11:46.140
I'm Melluar, the monster master. 
Nice to meet you.

11:47.520 --> 11:49.430
And also, goodbye.

12:30.640 --> 12:32.310
Take care of that, too.

12:40.930 --> 12:43.320
Pierce them, Icicle Drop!

12:47.310 --> 12:49.040
Flying Sword, Slash Blossom!

12:52.950 --> 12:55.370
It's not over yet! Get 'em!

13:09.920 --> 13:12.260
There, three down.

13:12.260 --> 13:13.590
Thanks, Thea.

13:14.180 --> 13:15.390
I'll finish Melluar.

13:15.800 --> 13:17.770
You two, take out the other monsters!

13:20.550 --> 13:22.860
Thanks for waiting, everyone!

13:29.370 --> 13:33.870
Now what? All of your toys are gone.

13:35.630 --> 13:37.400
What's wrong with you?!

13:37.400 --> 13:40.540
No modifications, no drugs? No fair!

13:40.540 --> 13:42.590
It's not fair...

13:44.360 --> 13:47.400
Damn it! Kill, kill, kill!

13:47.400 --> 13:50.480
Alizee! Kill them!

13:54.280 --> 13:56.060
I'm sorry, Alizee.

13:59.020 --> 14:00.390
Alizee!

14:00.390 --> 14:01.520
Oh, no!

14:10.820 --> 14:14.410
I have pierced your magic organ. It's over.

14:28.080 --> 14:30.700
That's the price you pay for 
toying with people's lives.

14:35.630 --> 14:37.780
I-I can't die...

14:38.590 --> 14:39.860
For Toma-sama...

14:40.560 --> 14:42.690
For Toma-sama!

14:42.690 --> 14:46.620
Impossible! How can she stay alive 
without her magic organ?!

14:46.620 --> 14:49.260
Her magic power is rising...

14:50.400 --> 14:54.640
My body has been modified.

14:55.530 --> 15:00.960
I have one extra lung, 
heart, and magic organ.

15:01.860 --> 15:03.960
I know, I'm a freak.

15:05.460 --> 15:08.470
We were created as weapons.

15:08.470 --> 15:11.770
No! No more experiments!

15:11.770 --> 15:13.220
Someone help me!

15:13.880 --> 15:15.980
No... No!

15:15.980 --> 15:16.930
No more!

15:24.580 --> 15:29.030
If Toma-sama hadn't saved me then...

15:29.900 --> 15:34.990
That's why, to destroy this damned world...

15:35.380 --> 15:38.240
I have to fight for Toma-sama!

15:38.820 --> 15:42.300
Here I go! Limit Break!

15:45.520 --> 15:47.020
"Limit Break"?!

15:47.020 --> 15:49.470
It allows the user to surpass all limitations.

15:49.470 --> 15:51.080
But the price is...

15:57.870 --> 15:58.970
Wh-What's that?!

16:04.560 --> 16:05.860
Chimera...

16:14.720 --> 16:16.490
It's showtime!

16:16.800 --> 16:19.200
Perfect Marionette Doll!

16:30.150 --> 16:33.930
She's fueling her magic power 
with her own life force and hatred.

16:33.930 --> 16:40.020
Now, everyone... Please die for us!

16:51.190 --> 16:52.560
He's wonderful, isn't he?

16:52.560 --> 16:55.030
My number one toy!

16:55.030 --> 16:58.280
Are you sure you want to dodge this?

17:00.690 --> 17:01.580
Yuhi!

17:01.580 --> 17:02.410
R-Right!

17:19.120 --> 17:20.140
Not bad!

17:20.430 --> 17:23.390
But how much longer can you stand it?

17:26.480 --> 17:27.710
This is tough...

17:27.710 --> 17:28.560
Thea-san!

17:28.560 --> 17:30.770
Elka, do you have a plan?

17:36.420 --> 17:37.280
Glein!

17:40.000 --> 17:45.060
Oof, that's rough.
But I have to break it all!

17:45.520 --> 17:48.800
If this world won't love me...

17:49.790 --> 17:51.020
Say your praye—

18:13.240 --> 18:14.190
Alizee...

18:22.390 --> 18:23.420
Amelle...

18:26.840 --> 18:30.870
Amelle, this is a nice village.

18:30.870 --> 18:33.950
The food is good, and the villagers are kind.

18:35.180 --> 18:37.940
I'm growing a bit tired of traveling,

18:37.940 --> 18:41.930
so once this issue is settled, 
I'd like to stay here for a while.

18:42.190 --> 18:46.680
Oh, please do! This house is 
too big for me to live in alone.

18:47.010 --> 18:50.940
So, during that time, 
you can treat me as a sister.

18:53.470 --> 18:56.940
Would you really be my big sister?

18:57.200 --> 19:00.340
Sure. I mean, if it's okay with you.

19:00.340 --> 19:02.190
Of course, Big Sis!

19:23.250 --> 19:25.020
It's all empty now.

19:39.360 --> 19:41.160
The healing magic is working.

19:41.630 --> 19:45.180
Her injuries are serious, 
but she will survive.

19:45.180 --> 19:47.850
Yes, I'm truly glad.

19:48.590 --> 19:51.690
Welcome back, Alizee.

19:54.360 --> 19:56.620
I didn't expect her to be so strong.

19:57.200 --> 19:59.510
We all need to take a break...

20:03.440 --> 20:04.510
Shadow.

20:11.600 --> 20:13.750
So they got Melluar.

20:18.070 --> 20:19.400
More enemies!

20:19.400 --> 20:20.570
Now, of all times...

20:20.820 --> 20:23.200
He seems really strong.

20:23.200 --> 20:25.570
Seems tough for us right now.

20:28.860 --> 20:30.830
I'll fight here!

20:31.230 --> 20:33.330
Everyone, please stand back!

20:35.580 --> 20:37.280
No, Yuhi!

20:37.280 --> 20:40.270
He's too much for you! Step back!

20:40.270 --> 20:41.440
Still!

20:42.560 --> 20:46.760
Didn't you tell me that I'm one of you, too?

20:47.710 --> 20:48.620
Besides...

20:49.090 --> 20:52.310
If Yuki-kun was in my place, 
I think he would fight.

20:53.060 --> 20:54.310
Yuhi...

20:57.720 --> 20:59.660
Right. Let's leave this to Yuhi.

20:59.660 --> 21:02.860
She's in much better 
fighting shape than we are.

21:03.420 --> 21:05.500
Glein is right.

21:05.500 --> 21:09.580
We'll trust Yuhi and provide backup.

21:11.070 --> 21:13.200
If you give up, I'll never forgive you.

21:13.200 --> 21:16.710
Right! Please see how my training's paid off!

21:18.980 --> 21:21.710
You seem quite the competent fighter.

21:27.070 --> 21:28.640
This magic power...

21:39.600 --> 21:41.430
You did well, Yuhi.

21:49.230 --> 21:50.620
You're safe now.

21:53.370 --> 21:55.100
Yuki-kun!

23:26.960 --> 23:31.970
<b><i>Next Time</i></b>

23:26.960 --> 23:31.970
<b><i>Going All-In for a Second Time</i></b>

23:27.570 --> 23:30.840
Next time: "Going All-In for a Second Time."
